&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span&gt;THIS SCENARIO WAS BROUGHT TO YOU BY THE FOUNDATION MTF ADMINISTRATION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span&gt;Say &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; to performance-enhancing drugs and &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ALWAYS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; report suspicious behavior, regardless of the source.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:small;&quot;&gt;This situation was extrapolated from real events for training purposes, names and designations have been altered for privacy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
